<h2>0.33.0</h2>
<h3>New</h3>
<ul>
<li>A devbox greets you over SSH too</li>
<li>A devbox is called inside what you called it</li>
</ul>
<h3>Fixed</h3>
<ul>
<li>This Mac's page stays put while the daemon restarts</li>
</ul>
<h2>0.32.1</h2>
<h3>Fixed</h3>
<ul>
<li>After an update the daemon is restarted without a button flashing by</li>
<li>Ssh into a devbox connects</li>
</ul>
<h2>0.32.0</h2>
<h3>New</h3>
<ul>
<li>Ssh into a devbox, through the Mac and never over the network</li>
<li>The update window says what is new</li>
</ul>
<h2>0.31.0</h2>
<h3>New</h3>
<ul>
<li>A devbox's terminal opens with a greeting</li>
</ul>
<h3>Fixed</h3>
<ul>
<li>A devbox's terminal shows characters and colours as the Mac's does</li>
</ul>
<h2>0.30.0</h2>
<h3>New</h3>
<ul>
<li>Devboxes, made and used from the command line</li>
<li>The app shows devboxes, makes one and opens a terminal in it</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
